  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7684533"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 313-35
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7684533"
    >
Severability.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7684533" data-guid="7684533"></div>
        <div id="questions-7684533" data-guid="7684533" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7684533_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any part of this article is declared unconstitutional or otherwise ineffective by a court of competent jurisdiction, such determination shall not invalidate the remaining provisions thereof, and, to that extent, the existing provisions shall remain in full force and effect.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7684534"
